# ── External runtimes and datasets ───────────────────────────────────────────
# The repository ships the external/ folder structure, its README files, and a
# small RMSX preannotated sample so users can paste the large / user-provided
# content locally. These three user-provided paths are intentionally NOT
# versioned (see external/*/README.md for what to place where):
external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_preannotated_input_output.tar.gz
external/rmsx_preannotated/rmsx_work_default/
external/rmsx/**/RNAVIEW/
external/fr3d/fr3d-python-latest/*
!external/fr3d/fr3d-python-latest/.gitkeep

# ── Python build artifacts ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# macOS metadata
.DS_Store

# Local instructions; keep out of GitHub
GITHUB_UPLOAD_INSTRUCTIONS.txt

# ── Local dev/test harness, not shipped with the plugin ──────────────────────
/tests/

# ── Structures fetched locally during development/testing ───────────────────
/*.cif
/*.cif.gz

# ── RMSX benchmark/test run outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────
/output/rmsx_results/
